;; fib.dns: a native DNS resolver (no getaddrinfo, no NSS: it works in a static binary in a FROM scratch image). Design: docs/design/dns.md.
;; (resolve-host (system-resolver) "example.com") answers (Ok ["93.184.216.34" "2606:2800:..."]) or an OSError; fib.dns.types, .decode and .encode are the wire format.
(ns fib.dns (:export-from fib.dns.types fib.dns.config fib.dns.cache fib.dns.resolve))
